  86:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** * Summary:
  87:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  Stops the clock and waits for the hardware to actually be disabled before
  88:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  returning. This ensures that the clock is never truncated (high part of the
  89:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  cycle will terminate before the clock is disabled and the API returns).
  90:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  Note that the source clock must be running or this API will never return as
  91:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  a stopped clock cannot be disabled.
  92:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *
  93:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** * Parameters:
