 174:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** * Summary:
 175:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  Modifies the clock divider and, thus, the frequency. When the clock divider
 176:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  register is set to zero or changed from zero, the clock will be temporarily
 177:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  disabled in order to change the SSS mode bit. If the clock is enabled when
