 405:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_SYNC_DIG
 406:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_IMO
 407:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_XTALM
 408:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_ILO
 409:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_PLL
 410:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   - CYCLK_SRC_SEL_XTALK
