 413:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *   See the Technical Reference Manual for details on clock sources.
 414:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *
 415:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** * Returns:
 416:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_4.c **** *  None
